      "raw": "# Windows validation (2026-10-19)\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Windows validation (2026-10-19)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "The MSVC x64 Release build completes with Qt 6.8.3 and CMake 4.4.4 when\n`LVRS_ENABLE_IPO=OFF`. The MSVC export scanner requires ordinary COFF objects.\nQML-only applications retain the shared DLL through its native resource\ninitialization symbol. `LVRSTests_windows_qml_link` verifies this without a\nbackend API reference. Tooltip fixtures use an explicit QByteArray branch type.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 11,
      "raw": "The build contains 59 CTest suites. After using Git for Windows for `sh`, Ninja\nfor nested configuration, and the basic Qt render loop for deterministic\nreadback, 52 suites pass. These seven suites still fail and require follow-up:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 12,
      "end_line": 12,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 13,
      "end_line": 19,
      "raw": "- LVRSTests_import_api\n- LVRSTests_list_composites\n- LVRSTests_figma_parity\n- LVRSTests_navigation_state\n- LVRSTests_svg_manager\n- LVRSTests_platform_integration\n- LVRSTests_visual_regression\n",
